Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:46:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] treble_app: add per app device spoofing

add a page to pick apps and the device values they should see. each
value goes to persist.sys.spoof.<last package segment>.<field>, which
the framework reads when the app starts, with a pixel preset to fill
the form. two packages with the same last segment would share their
props, so the second one is refused.
